                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Eutrophication Levels of Hydropower Plant Water Reservoirs Via Trophic State Index With Evaluation of the Fate of Pollutants Affected By the Land Use Model</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2024-08-22">22 August 2024</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
